                       DayDream BBS V1.26, Callers.log
                       -------------------------------

OFFSET  TYPE     LENGTH  DESCRIPTION                                     FLAGS
==============================================================================
 0000   WORD       02    USERID                                            (-)
 0002   WORD       02    NODE NUMBER                                       (-)
 0004   LONG WORD  04    LOGON DATE AND TIME (SECS SINCE 1-JAN-78)         (-)
 0008   LONG WORD  04    LOGOFF DATE AND TIME (SECS SINCE 1-JAN-78)        (-)
 0012   LONG WORD  04    TOTAL TIME ONLINE                                 (-)
 0016   LONG WORD  04    BYTES UPLOADED                                    (-) 
 0020   LONG WORD  04    BYTES DOWNLOADED                                  (-) 
 0024   WORD       02    FILES UPLOADED                                    (-)
 0026   WORD       02    FILES DOWNLOADED                                  (-)
 0028   WORD       02    PRIVATE MESSAGES WRITTEN                          (-) 
 0030   WORD       02    PUBLIC MESSAGES WRITTEN                           (-) 
 0032   LONG WORD  04    CONNECTION SPEED                                  (-)	   
 0036   LONG WORD  04    FLAGS                                             (1)
 0040   FREE BLOCK 260   FREE SPACE RESERVED FOR FUTURE DEVELOPMENT        (-)
 0300   END        00    END OF STRUCTURE
==============================================================================

BIT   DESCRIPTION                                             CALLERSLOG FLAGS
==============================================================================
000   0: NORMAL LOGOFF                 1: LOST CARRIER
001   0: OLD USER :-)                  1: NEW USER
002                                    1: CHATTED WITH SYSOP
003                                    1: PASSWORD FAILURE
004                                    1: PAGED SYSOP
005                                    1: RELOGINED
006                                    1: TELNET NODE/CONNECT
007                                    1: SYSOP COMMAND (USERED, SHELL)
008                                    1: UPLOAD FAILED.
009                                    1: DOWNLOAD FAILED.
